      "description": "Enroll a custom cloned voice from an audio sample (async). Requires a Pro or active 7-day pass key. Provide exactly one of audio_base64 or audio_url (https). Sample limits: 10 MB max upload; wav, mp3 or m4a; a 10–30 second clean single-speaker recording (enrollment rejects clips shorter than 10 or longer than 30 seconds; trim longer recordings first). Account limits: maximum 3 cloned voices, 5 enrollments per day. Returns a voice_id with status \"enrolling\" — check list_voices until its status is \"ready\" (there is no job to poll), then use it in create_podcast (Pro key) or in POST /api/v1/audio/speech (REST, same key).",
      "inputSchema": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "required": [
              "audio_base64"
            ]
          },
          {
            "required": [
              "audio_url"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "properties": {
          "audio_base64": {
            "description": "Base64-encoded audio sample (10 MB max decoded).",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "audio_url": {
            "description": "https URL to the audio sample — fetched server-side, same 10 MB bound.",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "consent": {
            "const": true,
            "description": "Required attestation: you confirm you have the recording rights to this audio sample. The server rejects anything but an explicit true.",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "mime_type": {
            "default": "audio/wav",
            "description": "Sample MIME type — wav, mp3 and m4a are accepted (the server enforces the exact allowlist).",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "name": {
            "description": "Display name for the cloned voice.",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
